  "title": "Home and household",
  "note": "Chez + a person means \"at (or to) someone's home\": chez moi, chez Paul, chez mes parents. Faire covers many chores: faire le ménage, faire la vaisselle, faire la cuisine. In France the ground floor is le rez-de-chaussée, so le premier étage is one floor up.",
